{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29875","headline":"夜思 · 李商隐","name":"夜思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"银箭耿寒漏，金釭凝夜光。\n彩鸾空自舞，别燕不相将。\n寄恨一尺素，含情双玉璫。\n会前犹月在，去後始宵长。\n往事经春物，前期托报章。\n永令虚粲枕，长不掩兰房。\n觉动迎猜影，疑来浪认香。\n鹤应闻露警，蜂亦爲花忙。\n古有阳台梦，今多下蔡倡。\n何爲薄冰雪，消瘦滞非乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29875.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29875","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}